ype=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236170/extras/fe210cdb5065f438b7a28dbdc59b9292.mp4?t=1748638833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add ships to your fleet to use for attacks, exploration, and discovery! Build ships to fight your enemies, to colonize planets, and to explore the unknown. Send your ships to new planets, to collect space loot, or just to explore the wonders and mysteries of the galaxy around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236170/extras/f865656a23d610d5e166ed8bde46b102.webp?t=1748638833\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236170/extras/ccd23bdbffb6536a20d977d0d42de98d.webp?t=1748638833\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236170/extras/e00c24fa7577138df80f94837974c9fa.poster.avif?t=1748638833\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236170/extras/e00c24fa7577138df80f94837974c9fa.webm?t=1748638833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236170/extras/e00c24fa7577138df80f94837974c9fa.mp4?t=1748638833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your ships to enemy planets to conquer the galaxy! By using a strategic combination of ships that can attack enemies, buff your other ships, and hit extra hard, there are limitless ways to engage the dangerous Proditum and deadly Grey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=